  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This seminar aims to establish connections between the outcomes of the agro-tourism mission and prospective partners, who will then develop follow-up projects based on separate cases.They will also create plans to ensure the agro-tourism model is included in future national and local policies.</narrative>
